{"seq":2,"slug":"code-splitting-and-lazy-loading","title":"代码分割与懒加载","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/optimization/code-splitting-and-lazy-loading","wordCount":680,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"代码分割与懒加载\">代码分割与懒加载</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>代码分割的思路是把单个巨型 bundle 拆成若干按需加载的块，让首屏只下载真正需要的代码，其余部分在用户即将用到时才拉取——即懒加载。实现路径主要有三种：入口点分割、动态 <code>import()</code> 分割，以及运行时的公共依赖提取（如 <code>manualChunks</code> / vendor 拆分）。判断分割是否合理要结合体积与请求数两个指标：过度分割会退化成请求瀑布流，反而拖慢加载。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要代码分割\">为什么需要代码分割</h2><p>一个不做代码分割的单页应用（SPA），所有的 JavaScript 代码会被打包为一个巨大的 Bundle。用户首次访问时需要下载、解析和执行全部代码，即使他们只需要查看首页。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 无代码分割&#10;        USER1[用户访问首页] --&gt; DOWNLOAD1[下载 2MB bundle.js&lt;br/&gt;包含所有页面代码]&#10;        DOWNLOAD1 --&gt; PARSE1[解析全部代码&lt;br/&gt;耗时 3s]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 有代码分割&#10;        USER2[用户访问首页] --&gt; DOWNLOAD2[下载 200KB main.js&lt;br/&gt;仅首页代码]&#10;        DOWNLOAD2 --&gt; PARSE2[解析首页代码&lt;br/&gt;耗时 0.3s]&#10;        USER2 -.-&gt;|稍后访问设置页| DOWNLOAD3[按需加载 50KB settings.js]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 无代码分割\n        USER1[用户访问首页] --&gt; DOWNLOAD1[下载 2MB bundle.js&lt;br/&gt;包含所有页面代码]\n        DOWNLOAD1 --&gt; PARSE1[解析全部代码&lt;br/&gt;耗时 3s]\n    end\n    subgraph 有代码分割\n        USER2[用户访问首页] --&gt; DOWNLOAD2[下载 200KB main.js&lt;br/&gt;仅首页代码]\n        DOWNLOAD2 --&gt; PARSE2[解析首页代码&lt;br/&gt;耗时 0.3s]\n        USER2 -.-&gt;|稍后访问设置页| DOWNLOAD3[按需加载 50KB settings.js]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"代码分割的三种策略\">代码分割的三种策略</h2><h3 id=\"1-入口点分割-multi-entry\">1. 入口点分割（Multi-Entry）</h3><p>为每个页面或入口定义独立的 entry，打包器为每个入口生成独立的 Bundle：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// webpack.config.js&#10;export default {&#10;  entry: {&#10;    home: &#39;./src/pages/home/index.ts&#39;,&#10;    dashboard: &#39;./src/pages/dashboard/index.ts&#39;,&#10;    admin: &#39;./src/pages/admin/index.ts&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  optimization: {&#10;    splitChunks: {&#10;      chunks: &#39;all&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// webpack.config.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entry: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    home: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./src/pages/home/index.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dashboard: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./src/pages/dashboard/index.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    admin: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./src/pages/admin/index.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  optimization: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    splitChunks: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      chunks: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'all'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"2-动态导入-dynamic-import\">2. 动态导入（Dynamic Import）</h3><p>使用 <code>import()</code> 语法在运行时按需加载模块。这是最常用的代码分割方式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 路由级别的代码分割&#10;const routes = [&#10;  {&#10;    path: &#39;/&#39;,&#10;    component: () =&gt; import(&#39;./pages/Home&#39;),&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    path: &#39;/dashboard&#39;,&#10;    component: () =&gt; import(&#39;./pages/Dashboard&#39;),&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    path: &#39;/settings&#39;,&#10;    component: () =&gt; import(&#39;./pages/Settings&#39;),&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 路由级别的代码分割</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> routes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    path: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    component</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./pages/Home'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    path: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/dashboard'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    component</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./pages/Dashboard'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    path: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/settings'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    component</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./pages/Settings'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><p>打包器遇到 <code>import()</code> 表达式时，会自动将目标模块及其依赖分割为独立的 Chunk：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    MAIN[main.js&lt;br/&gt;路由配置 + 公共代码]&#10;    HOME[home.chunk.js&lt;br/&gt;首页组件]&#10;    DASH[dashboard.chunk.js&lt;br/&gt;仪表板组件]&#10;    SETTINGS[settings.chunk.js&lt;br/&gt;设置组件]&#10;    VENDOR[vendor.chunk.js&lt;br/&gt;React + ReactDOM]&#10;&#10;    MAIN --&gt;|动态导入| HOME&#10;    MAIN --&gt;|动态导入| DASH&#10;    MAIN --&gt;|动态导入| SETTINGS&#10;    MAIN --&gt; VENDOR\">graph TD\n    MAIN[main.js&lt;br/&gt;路由配置 + 公共代码]\n    HOME[home.chunk.js&lt;br/&gt;首页组件]\n    DASH[dashboard.chunk.js&lt;br/&gt;仪表板组件]\n    SETTINGS[settings.chunk.js&lt;br/&gt;设置组件]\n    VENDOR[vendor.chunk.js&lt;br/&gt;React + ReactDOM]\n\n    MAIN --&gt;|动态导入| HOME\n    MAIN --&gt;|动态导入| DASH\n    MAIN --&gt;|动态导入| SETTINGS\n    MAIN --&gt; VENDOR</pre><h3 id=\"3-vendor-分割\">3. Vendor 分割</h3><p>将第三方库与业务代码分离，利用浏览器缓存提升复访速度：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// webpack.config.js&#10;export default {&#10;  optimization: {&#10;    splitChunks: {&#10;      cacheGroups: {&#10;        react: {&#10;          test: /[\\\\/]node_modules[\\\\/](react|react-dom)[\\\\/]/,&#10;          name: &#39;react-vendor&#39;,&#10;          chunks: &#39;all&#39;,&#10;          priority: 20,&#10;        },&#10;        vendor: {&#10;          test: /[\\\\/]node_modules[\\\\/]/,&#10;          name: &#39;vendor&#39;,&#10;          chunks: &#39;all&#39;,&#10;          priority: 10,&#10;        },&#10;        common: {&#10;          minChunks: 2,&#10;          name: &#39;common&#39;,&#10;          chunks: &#39;all&#39;,&#10;          priority: 5,&#10;          reuseExistingChunk: true,&#10;        },&#10;      },&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// webpack.config.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  optimization: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    splitChunks: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      cacheGroups: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        react: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          test:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\\\</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">/]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">node_modules</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\\\</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">/]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(react</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">react-dom)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\\\</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">/]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'react-vendor'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          chunks: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'all'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          priority: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        vendor: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          test:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\\\</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">/]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">node_modules</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\\\</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">/]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'vendor